t  her bath is filled with hot water that  was brought up from the kitchen  the water was scalding hot but it has no  effect on danny  she does not flinch or even cry out she  knew this would happen because visceras  would always tell her  ours is the house of the dragon the fire  is in our blood this  is the foreshadowing for when daenerys  hatches her dragon eggs  after her bath they get her all dolled  up ready to be presented to call drogo  but of course viserys is never satisfied  with how danny looks therefore he has to  remind her  as soon as he sees her all dressed up he  says  she looks too skinny illyria is like  come on man  look at her look at that silver gold  hair those violet eyes  she is the blood of old valeria ian  highborn  daughter of the old king and sister to  the new king  there is no way called drogo will not  like her but  viserys is like i suppose although he  sounds like he doubts this will work  once again he will not give daenerys his  approval  she is the one making the sacrifices for  what he wants  as i said before she does not want the  iron throne  you know viserys actually reminds me of  joffrey in this chapter  viserys says he will kill robert  baratheon himself but we all know he has  never swung his sword at a man  joffrey said he would kill stannis  baratheon and rob stark  but we all know he has never swung his  sword and a man either  guess who they both did end up hurting  who did they direct their anger  and frustrations at sons and danny  instead of actually fighting on the  field of battle for themselves  they would physically and verbally abuse  13 year old little girls sons and danny  would both go on to achieve what joffrey  and viserys could never do on their own  anyways as viserys and illyrio are  having a conversation  daenerys once again thinks about how she  does not trust  anything illyrio says but viserys is  eating it up because illyrio  is selling him his dream he says  everything he knows viserys wants to  hear  he tells viserys how everyone across the  sea is crying out for their king  he says they are your people and they  love you well  men are toasting to your health while  women are sowing dragon banners and hide  them against the day of your return from  across the water  daenerys doesn't believe him while  viserys is sitting there  nodding his head in agreement alright  now let's get to the final scene of the  chapter when daenerys meets carl drogo  inside the mans the air was heavy with  the set of spices  sweet lemon and cinnamon they were  escorted across the entry  hall where a mosaic of colored glass  depicted the doom of valyria  oil burned in black iron lanterns all  along the walls  one of the eunuchs sang of their arrival  viserys of house targaryen  the third of his name he called in a  high sweet voice  king of the andals and the rhoynar and  the first men lord of the seven kingdoms  and the protector of the realm  his sister daenerys stormborn princess  of dragonstone  his honorable host elirio mopotus  magister of the free cities of pentos  the room was filled with the thracky  horselords  and sellswords and followers of velour  and the lords from the summer isles with  skin as black as ebony  daenerys looked at them all in wonder  and soon realized  she was the only woman there she was  afraid illyrio then whispered to  daenerys and her brother  those three are drogo's blood riders  over there  the man that has the green beard is the  brother to the archon of tyrosh  and the man behind him is sir jorah  mormont  now that last name got dany's attention  dany found herself  looking at sergiora mormont he was an  older man  over the age of 40 but he was still in  good shape for his age  dany notices the black bear of house  mormont embroidered on his chest  it's not often dany sees someone from  westeros  now although she has no memory of ever  living there i think she does initially  find some comfort in knowing sergiora  mormont is from her homeland  maybe this is a step in the right  direction but this  feeling soon evaporates when she sets  her eyes upon call drogo  she is frightened by the sight of him  dany wanted to run and hide  but she knew this would anger her  brother she knew this would wake the  dragon  viserys has her so beaten down mentally  physically and emotionally  she does as he says although she is very  afraid  danny notices that carl drogo was a head  taller than the tallest man in the room  yet somehow he was laid on his feet  almost graceful  he was younger than she thought he would  be no more than 30  but still twice her age his skin was the  color of copper  and his thick mustachios was bound with  gold and bronze rings  this is when viserys grabs danny by the  arm and squeezes her until it hurts  do you see his brave sweet sister  drogo's braid was black as midnight  and heavy with scented oil and there  were tiny bells in it that rang softly  as he moved  they swung well below his belt the end  of it brushing against the back of his  thighs  you see how long it is viserys said when  dothraki are defeated in combat  they cut off their braids in disgrace so  the world will know their shame  called drogo has never lost a fight he  is  aegon the dragonlord come again and you  will be his queen  danny was afraid of her brother but not  as afraid as she was of col drogo  danny does not want to marry him she  wants to go home  when viserys hears this he flies off the  handle  just like he did in this show in fact  what he says to danny is almost  identical to what he said in the show  how are we to go home sweet sister they  took her home from us  he drew her into the shadows out of  sight his fingers digging into her skin  how are we to go home he repeated  meaning king's landing in dragonstone  and all the realm they had lost dany had  only meant their rooms in illyrio's  estate  but there was no home for him there not  even the big house that had the red door  that was never home for vi